WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.860
400 years ago in Florence, Italy

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.700
A new style of music was created which led to the birth
of opera.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.720
And for this new music, an instrument was invented to accompany the human voice.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.200
They began with a lute

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.700
and in search for a louder deeper bass range

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:21.300
added a second neck with long strings up to 6 feet in length.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.640
The Italians called it the "Chitarone"

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.020
or "Tiorba"

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.660
In English, we call it the "Theorbo."

